function UsersPage({users,trainers,setNotice,onUsersChange,onTrainersChange}){const [query,setQuery]=useState('');const [modal,setModal]=useState(null);const [selected,setSelected]=useState(null);const [busy,setBusy]=useState(false);const [form,setForm]=useState({username:'',email:'',password:'',role:'MEMBER',name:'',age:'',phone:'',specialty:'',membershipType:'',membershipStartDate:'',membershipEndDate:'',trainerId:''});const items=Array.isArray(users)?users:[];const trainerOptions=Array.isArray(trainers)?trainers:[];const filtered=items.filter(u=>{const q=query.trim().toLowerCase();return !q||[u.displayName,u.username,u.email,u.role].some(v=>String(v||'').toLowerCase().includes(q))});const resetForm=()=>setForm({username:'',email:'',password:'',role:'MEMBER',name:'',age:'',phone:'',specialty:'',membershipType:'',membershipStartDate:'',membershipEndDate:'',trainerId:''});const close=()=>{if(!busy){setModal(null);setSelected(null);resetForm()}};const create=async e=>{e.preventDefault();if(form.role==='MEMBER'&&new Date(form.membershipEndDate)<new Date(form.membershipStartDate)){setNotice('Membership end date must be after the start date.');return}setBusy(true);try{const generatedUsername=(form.email.trim().split('@')[0].replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9]/g,'')||'user')+'_'+Date.now();const registerPayload={username:generatedUsername,email:form.email.trim(),password:form.password,role:form.role,displayName:form.role==='TRAINER'?form.name.trim():'',trainerName:form.role==='TRAINER'?form.name.trim():'',trainerSpecialty:form.role==='TRAINER'?form.specialty.trim():'',trainerPhone:form.role==='TRAINER'?form.phone.trim():'',trainerAge:form.role==='TRAINER'&&form.age?Number(form.age):null};console.log('Add Trainer API Request:',{...registerPayload,password:undefined});const registered=await authApi.register(registerPayload);console.log('Add Trainer API Response:',registered?.data);let refreshed=await gymApi.users();let created=Array.isArray(refreshed.data)?refreshed.data.find(u=>String(u.email||'').toLowerCase()===form.email.trim().toLowerCase()||String(u.username||'').toLowerCase()===form.username.trim().toLowerCase()):null;const registeredUser=registered?.data?.user||registered?.data;if(!created&&registeredUser&&typeof registeredUser==='object')created=registeredUser;if(form.role==='TRAINER'){const trainerResponse=await gymApi.trainers();onTrainersChange?.(Array.isArray(trainerResponse.data)?trainerResponse.data:[])}if(form.role==='MEMBER'){if(!created?.id){throw new Error('User was created, but its account ID could not be found. Please refresh users and create the member profile again.')}const payload={name:form.name.trim(),age:Number(form.age),phone:form.phone.trim(),membershipType:form.membershipType,membershipStartDate:form.membershipStartDate,membershipEndDate:form.membershipEndDate,user:{id:Number(created.id)}};if(form.trainerId)payload.trainer={id:Number(form.trainerId)};await gymApi.createMember(payload);refreshed=await gymApi.users()};onUsersChange(Array.isArray(refreshed.data)?refreshed.data:[...items]);setNotice(form.role==='MEMBER'?'Member user and profile created successfully.':'User created successfully.');close()}catch(error){setNotice(errorMessage(error))}finally{setBusy(false)}};const remove=async()=>{if(!selected?.id)return;setBusy(true);try{await gymApi.deleteUser(selected.id);onUsersChange(items.filter(u=>u.id!==selected.id));setNotice('User deleted successfully.');close()}catch(error){setNotice(errorMessage(error))}finally{setBusy(false)}};return <div className="dash-body"><div className="page-heading"><div><span className="eyebrow">MANAGEMENT / USERS</span><h2>User Management</h2><p>Manage gym accounts created by the owner.</p></div><button className="primary-btn" onClick={()=>{resetForm();setModal('add')}}><Plus size={16}/> Add User</button></div><div className="toolbar"><div className="search"><Search size={16}/><input placeholder="Search users..." value={query} onChange={e=>setQuery(e.target.value)}/></div><span>{filtered.length} users</span></div><div className="member-table-card"><div className="table-summary"><b>{filtered.length} users</b><span>Owner access only</span></div>{filtered.length?<div className="table-wrap"><table className="users-table"><thead><tr><th>User</th><th>Email</th><th>Role</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody>{filtered.map(u=><tr key={u.id}><td><div className="member-cell"><span className="list-avatar">{String(u.displayName||u.username||u.email||'U')[0].toUpperCase()}</span><span><b>{u.displayName||u.username||'Unnamed user'}</b></span></div></td><td>{u.email||''}</td><td><StatusBadge status={u.role||'UNKNOWN'}/></td><td><div className="action-buttons"><button title="Edit" onClick={()=>{setSelected(u);setForm({displayName:u.displayName||''});setModal('edit')}}><Sparkles size={15}/></button><button title="Delete" className="danger-icon" disabled={busy} onClick={()=>{setSelected(u);setModal('delete')}}><Trash2 size={15}/></button></div></td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>:<div className="empty-state"><Users size={25}/><b>No users found</b><span>Users created by the owner will appear here.</span></div>}</div>{modal==='add'&&<Modal title="Create User" onClose={close}><form className="modal-form" onSubmit={create}><label>Email<input required type="email" value={form.email} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,email:e.target.value})}/></label><label>Password<input required minLength="6" type="password" value={form.password} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,password:e.target.value})}/></label><label>Role<select required value={form.role} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,role:e.target.value})}><option value="MEMBER">MEMBER</option><option value="TRAINER">TRAINER</option><option value="OWNER">OWNER</option></select></label>{form.role==='MEMBER'&&<><div className="form-section-title">Member Information</div><label>Full Name<input required value={form.name} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,name:e.target.value})}/></label><label>Age<input required type="number" min="1" max="120" value={form.age} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,age:e.target.value})}/></label><label>Phone<input required value={form.phone} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,phone:e.target.value})}/></label><label>Membership Plan<select required value={form.membershipType} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,membershipType:e.target.value})}><option value="">Select plan</option><option value="Basic">Basic</option><option value="Premium">Premium</option><option value="VIP">VIP</option></select></label><div className="membership-price"><small>Membership price</small><b>{form.membershipType?`\u20B9${membershipPrices[form.membershipType]}`:'Select a plan'}</b></div><label>Membership Start Date<input required type="date" value={form.membershipStartDate} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,membershipStartDate:e.target.value})}/></label><label>Membership End Date<input required type="date" value={form.membershipEndDate} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,membershipEndDate:e.target.value})}/></label><label>Assigned Trainer<select value={form.trainerId} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,trainerId:e.target.value})}><option value="">No trainer assigned</option>{trainerOptions.map(t=><option key={t.trainerId||t.id} value={t.trainerId||t.id}>{t.name}{t.specialty?` - ${t.specialty}`:''}</option>)}</select></label></>}{form.role==='TRAINER'&&<><div className="form-section-title">Trainer Information</div><label>Full Name<input required value={form.name} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,name:e.target.value})}/></label><label>Age<input type="number" min="1" max="120" value={form.age} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,age:e.target.value})}/></label><label>Specialty<input required value={form.specialty} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,specialty:e.target.value})}/></label><label>Phone<input required value={form.phone} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,phone:e.target.value})}/></label></>}<div className="modal-actions"><button type="button" className="outline-btn" onClick={close}>Cancel</button><button className="primary-btn" disabled={busy}>{busy?'Creating...':'Create User'}</button></div></form></Modal>}{modal==='edit'&&selected&&<Modal title="Edit display name" onClose={close}><form className="modal-form" onSubmit={async e=>{e.preventDefault();setBusy(true);try{const result=await gymApi.updateUserDisplayName(selected.id,form.displayName);onUsersChange(items.map(u=>u.id===selected.id?{...u,...result.data}:u));setNotice('Display name updated successfully.');close()}catch(error){setNotice(errorMessage(error))}finally{setBusy(false)}}}><label>Display name<input required maxLength="120" value={form.displayName||selected.displayName||''} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,displayName:e.target.value})} placeholder="Enter a professional display name"/></label><div className="details-modal"><div className="detail-grid"><div><small>Login username</small><b>{selected.username||'-'}</b></div><div><small>Email</small><b>{selected.email||'-'}</b></div><div><small>Role</small><b>{selected.role||'-'}</b></div></div></div><div className="modal-actions"><button type="button" className="outline-btn" onClick={close}>Cancel</button><button className="primary-btn" disabled={busy}>{busy?'Saving...':'Save display name'}</button></div></form></Modal>}{modal==='delete'&&selected&&<Modal title="Delete User?" onClose={close}><div className="details-modal"><p>Are you sure you want to delete <b>{selected.username||selected.email||'this user'}</b>?</p><p>This action cannot be undone.</p><div className="modal-actions"><button type="button" className="outline-btn" disabled={busy} onClick={close}>Cancel</button><button type="button" className="primary-btn danger-btn" disabled={busy} onClick={remove}>{busy?'Deleting...':'Delete User'}</button></div></div></Modal>}</div>}function ResourcePage({title,rows,type,search,setSearch,owner,setNotice,reload}){const [open,setOpen]=useState(false);const [editing,setEditing]=useState(null);const [editLoading,setEditLoading]=useState(false);const [deleteTarget,setDeleteTarget]=useState(null);const [busy,setBusy]=useState(false);const [form,setForm]=useState({});const singular=type==='users'?'user':type.slice(0,-1);const close=()=>{if(!busy){setOpen(false);setEditing(null);setForm({})}};const finishClose=()=>{setOpen(false);setEditing(null);setForm({})};const openAdd=()=>{setEditing(null);setForm({});setOpen(true)};const openEdit=async row=>{console.log('Trainer data before opening Edit modal:',row);setEditing(row);setForm({name:row.name||'',specialty:row.specialty||'',phone:row.phone||'',email:row.email||'',age:row.age||'',userId:row.userId||'',id:row.id||''});setOpen(true);setEditLoading(true);try{const response=await gymApi.trainer(row.id);console.log('Trainer Edit API Response:',response?.data);const trainer=response?.data||row;setForm({name:trainer.name||'',specialty:trainer.specialty||'',phone:trainer.phone||'',email:trainer.email||'',age:trainer.age||'',userId:trainer.userId||row.userId||'',id:trainer.id||row.id||''});setEditing({...row,...trainer})}catch(error){setNotice(errorMessage(error))}finally{setEditLoading(false)}};const removeResource=async()=>{if(!deleteTarget)return;setBusy(true);try{if(type==='trainers')await gymApi.deleteTrainer(deleteTarget.id);if(type==='payments')await gymApi.deletePayment(deleteTarget.paymentId||deleteTarget.id);setNotice(type==='trainers'?'Trainer deleted successfully.':'Payment deleted successfully.');setDeleteTarget(null);reload()}catch(error){setNotice(errorMessage(error))}finally{setBusy(false)}};const submit=async(e)=>{e.preventDefault();setBusy(true);try{if(type==='users')await authApi.register({username:form.username,email:form.email,password:form.password,role:form.role});if(type==='trainers'){const trainerPayload={name:form.name?.trim(),specialty:form.specialty?.trim(),phone:form.phone?.trim(),age:form.age?Number(form.age):null,email:form.email?.trim()};if(editing){console.log('Update Trainer API Request:',{id:editing.id,...trainerPayload});const trainerResponse=await gymApi.updateTrainer(editing.id,trainerPayload);console.log('Update Trainer API Response:',trainerResponse?.data)}else{console.log('Add Trainer API Request:',trainerPayload);const trainerResponse=await gymApi.createTrainer(trainerPayload);console.log('Add Trainer API Response:',trainerResponse?.data)}}if(type==='payments')await gymApi.createPayment({amount:Number(form.amount),paymentDate:form.paymentDate,paymentMethod:form.paymentMethod,paymentStatus:form.paymentStatus,member:form.memberId?{id:Number(form.memberId)}:null});if(editing&&type==='trainers')setNotice('Trainer updated successfully.');else setNotice(`${singular} added successfully.`);finishClose();reload()}catch(x){setNotice(errorMessage(x))}finally{setBusy(false)}};return <div className="dash-body"><div className="page-heading"><div><span className="eyebrow">DIRECTORY</span><h2>{title}</h2><p>Manage your gym data securely.</p></div>{owner&&type!=='members'&&<button className="primary-btn" onClick={openAdd}><Plus size={16}/> Add {singular}</button>}</div><div className="toolbar"><div className="search"><Search size={16}/><input placeholder={'Search '+type+'...'} value={search} onChange={e=>setSearch(e.target.value)}/></div><span>{rows.length} records</span></div><ResourceTable rows={rows} type={type} owner={owner} setNotice={setNotice} onEdit={type==='trainers'?openEdit:null} onDelete={type==='trainers'||type==='payments'?setDeleteTarget:null}/>{open&&<Modal title={editing?'Edit trainer':'Add '+singular} onClose={close}><form className={'modal-form ' + (editing ? 'trainer-edit-form' : '')} onSubmit={submit}>{editLoading&&editing&&<div className="loading-state"><span className="spinner"/>Loading trainer details...</div>}{type==='users'&&<><label>Username<input required value={form.username||''} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,username:e.target.value})}/></label><label>Email<input required type="email" value={form.email||''} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,email:e.target.value})}/></label><label>Password<input required minLength="6" type="password" value={form.password||''} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,password:e.target.value})}/></label><label>Role<select value={form.role||'MEMBER'} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,role:e.target.value})}><option>MEMBER</option><option>TRAINER</option><option>OWNER</option></select></label></>}{type==='trainers'&&<><div className="form-section-title">Personal Information</div><label>Full Name<input required disabled={editLoading} value={form.name||''} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,name:e.target.value})}/></label><label>Age<input type="number" min="1" max="120" disabled={editLoading} value={form.age||''} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,age:e.target.value})}/></label><label>Email<input required={!!editing} type="email" disabled={editLoading} value={form.email||''} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,email:e.target.value})}/></label><label>Phone Number<input required disabled={editLoading} value={form.phone||''} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,phone:e.target.value})}/></label><div className="form-section-title">Professional Information</div><label>Specialty<input required disabled={editLoading} value={form.specialty||''} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,specialty:e.target.value})}/></label></>}{type==='payments'&&<><label>Amount<input required type="number" min="1" value={form.amount||''} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,amount:e.target.value})}/></label><label>Date<input required type="date" value={form.paymentDate||''} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,paymentDate:e.target.value})}/></label><label>Method<select value={form.paymentMethod||'CASH'} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,paymentMethod:e.target.value})}><option>CASH</option><option>UPI</option><option>CARD</option></select></label><label>Status<select value={form.paymentStatus||'COMPLETED'} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,paymentStatus:e.target.value})}><option>COMPLETED</option><option>PENDING</option></select></label><label>Member ID<input required type="number" value={form.memberId||''} onChange={e=>setForm({...form,memberId:e.target.value})}/></label></>}<div className="modal-actions"><button type="button" className="outline-btn" onClick={close}>Cancel</button><button className="primary-btn" disabled={busy||editLoading}>{busy?'Saving...':editing?'Update trainer':'Save'}</button></div></form></Modal>}{deleteTarget&&<Modal title={type==='trainers'?'Delete trainer?':'Delete payment?'} onClose={()=>!busy&&setDeleteTarget(null)}><div className="details-modal delete-confirmation"><div className="delete-confirmation-icon"><Trash2 size={20}/></div><h3>Remove {deleteTarget.name|| (type==='payments'?'this payment':'this trainer')}?</h3><p>{type==='trainers'?'This will remove the trainer profile and detach assigned members. The linked login account will remain available.':'This payment record will be permanently removed from the database.'}</p><div className="modal-actions"><button type="button" className="outline-btn" disabled={busy} onClick={()=>setDeleteTarget(null)}>Cancel</button><button type="button" className="primary-btn danger-btn" disabled={busy} onClick={removeResource}>{busy?'Deleting...':type==='trainers'?'Delete trainer':'Delete payment'}</button></div></div></Modal>}</div>}
function ResourceTable({rows,type,owner,setNotice,onEdit,onDelete}){if(!rows?.length)return <div className="empty-state"><Sparkles size={24}/><b>No {type} found</b><span>Data will appear here when available from your backend.</span></div>;const keys=type==='members'?['name','age','phone','membershipType','membershipEndDate']:type==='trainers'?['name','specialty','phone','userId','email']:type==='users'?['username','email','role']:['paymentId','paymentDate','paymentMethod','paymentStatus','amount'];return <div className="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr>{keys.map(k=><th key={k}>{k.replace(/[A-Z]/g,' $&')}</th>)}{owner&&<th>Action</th>}</tr></thead><tbody>{rows.map((r,i)=><tr key={r.id||r.paymentId||i}>{keys.map(k=><td key={k}>{k==='amount'?money(r[k]):String(r[k]??'')}</td>)}{owner&&<td>{type==='trainers'&&onEdit&&<button className="edit-btn" title="Edit trainer" onClick={()=>onEdit(r)}><Sparkles size={15}/></button>}{(type==='trainers'||type==='payments')&&onDelete&&<button className="delete-btn" title={type==='payments'?'Delete payment':'Delete trainer'} onClick={()=>onDelete(r)}><Trash2 size={15}/></button>}{type!=='trainers'&&type!=='payments'&&<button className="delete-btn" onClick={()=>setNotice('Delete confirmation is ready  connect the delete action to your preferred workflow.')}><Trash2 size={15}/></button>}</td>}</tr>)}</tbody></table></div>}export default App;









